			"notes": "Bug fixes: the next note of B1 is C2 instead of C1.\nNew feature: the relative octave of instrument can be shown. \n\nLet the \"lowest octave of the instrument\" be i;\nThe relation shows as \"(Bass)\" - none - \"(Treble)\", which are [ from F#(i) to B[i] ], [ from C(i+1) to B(i+1) ] and [ from C(i+2) to F#(i+2) ]."
